WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.030
Da Nang is waiting for you to explore! Meet Danavi, your smart companion for every trip.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.610
Just type “beautiful beaches”. The AI understands what you mean and brings up the best beaches in an instant.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:18.160
Standing in front of an unfamiliar landmark? Choose a photo, and the AI tells you what it is and the story behind it. This is the Dragon Bridge!

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:25.350
Need advice? The AI assistant is ready to help, from must-try local dishes to places you cannot miss.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:31.180
The home screen suggests places for you, interesting spots nearby, and every festival just one tap away.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.150
Everything you need before you go: an introduction, opening hours, useful tips, and similar places to explore next.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.530
One tap brings up your route with step-by-step directions. No getting lost!

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:50.530
The map brings together the city’s places and festivals, with a separate mode for each. Tap for information, photos and tips.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:55.080
Want the big picture? Switch to the satellite map and check the traffic too.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.580
Travelling with international friends? One tap switches the whole app to English.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.630
Share your experiences with the community through reviews and photos.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.890
If you enjoy Danavi, you can support the project with a single QR code scan.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.400
Danavi is coming soon to Google Play. Open the app, and Da Nang is yours!
